{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午7時40分，天文台錄得24.3°C，相對濕度64%。</p><p>天文台表示，乾燥的大陸氣流正為廣東帶來晴朗的天氣。</p><p>本港方面，今早（23日）大部分地區的氣溫降至24°C左右。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.046051+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:52:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:25.479766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T00:17:57.908280+00:00","content_hash":"6e9fa9bb9a72e6217fc974d2f1f543134d649b974b3429a9b4be3ce1459dba02","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}